{"version":1,"key":"card:304","content":{"id":304,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a11d9486-9436-464d-b32f-10d767263202","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件公司的两种管理管理方式："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"2ef77487-4bc7-4af6-90e4-78f1139f1253","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8188a926-f616-4e3f-b5c8-86abb8718713","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35dcf407-1f9a-4073-bd36-28a37378d36d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Widget Factories（小工厂模式）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d86173a0-d27e-4444-a153-c04da70b538d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认为人是懒惰的，能不干活就不干活，甚至逃避干活，对集体的目标并不关心。于是通过强组织的解构对人员进行管理。喜欢谈论资源（人也被看作是一种资源）、流程、效率和可复用性等。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e04fc87-849a-4e76-91d2-b4d49ee0bf9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件开发流程一般为由 PM 准备一份软件说明书，事先安排好预算，软件开发团队就像是工厂里的工人一样，获取不到项目的原始信息，每一个人都是可替代的。软件开发过程对管理者来说一点都不重要，一旦将需求变作可工作的代码，软件团队就不重要了。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c7b8e56b-695d-466f-be0d-eecd2fc79359","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d3699894-3848-485b-9d36-81c251a98446","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Film Crews（电影制作组）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"957a9dbe-d465-4eb2-9ce6-7ae7517716ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认为人是高创造性和高智力的，即使没有外部的压力和惩罚，每个人也会努力的工作，并且享受工作，享受软件创造的过程。该种方式主张平等的工作只能，每个人都能获取到主要的项目原始信息，有自己的判断，并且以自己的方式去完成团队的目标。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8788886a-9cfb-4901-b068-13d4b6d0c69b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大多数公司都是基于 Widget Factories 进行管理的，依赖流程制作出一些无聊的软件。成功的软件公司就会趋向于 Film Crews 的管理方式，这种方式更容易吸引到牛人，只有吸引到了牛人，才能做出伟大的软件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e41c5bc6-756d-439f-8202-1acd47ce6939","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"21cd7b55-e676-44f5-aba7-a74f67233f0a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6a1f9dc4-3934-42b6-b48f-28ea34d1e42b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f98ed301-e07b-4359-8abb-d3bcaddfe570","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://coolshell.cn/articles/4951.html","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4b286281-f161-46fe-83db-82e9831e1d38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件公司的两种管理方式"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["杂","公司管理"],"createTime":1693104128884,"updateTime":1767361154284,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767361154284}}